---
description: Prepare one validateSynchronization evidence slice.
args: { goal: string; records: AccessibleSegment[]; evidence: EvidenceItem[] }
returns: EvidenceSlice
---
Select a bounded evidence slice for the exact subject and task. Include supporting and contradictory versions, authority, and freshness. Record searched scope and missing decisive facts. Apply this stage's relevance rule: Run exact timing, overlap, reading-rate, and format checks, then review narrative completeness and usability. Inspect transitions and dense scenes where local compliance may still produce an inaccessible overall experience. Return source item IDs and evidence, not conclusions or a corpus-wide paraphrase.
